bookmarks:0: repeat with qi from 1 to count bookmarks of boundDoc
bookmarks:1: set qb to bookmark qi of boundDoc
bookmarks:2: set qa to start of bookmark of qb
bookmarks:3: set qz to end of bookmark of qb
bookmarks:4: set qhashStart to qa
bookmarks:5: if qualityDelta > 0 and qa is qualityPoint and qz > qualityPoint then set qhashStart to qa + qualityDelta
bookmarks:6: set qr to create range boundDoc start qhashStart end qz
bookmarks:7: set recoveryTask to current application's NSTask's alloc()'s init()
bookmarks:8: recoveryTask's setLaunchPath:"/usr/bin/shasum"
bookmarks:9: recoveryTask's setArguments:{"-a", "256"}
bookmarks:10: set recoveryInput to current application's NSPipe's pipe()
bookmarks:11: set recoveryOutput to current application's NSPipe's pipe()
bookmarks:12: recoveryTask's setStandardInput:recoveryInput
bookmarks:13: recoveryTask's setStandardOutput:recoveryOutput
bookmarks:14: recoveryTask's setStandardError:(current application's NSFileHandle's fileHandleWithNullDevice())
bookmarks:15: set recoveryData to (current application's NSString's stringWithString:(content of qr as text))'s dataUsingEncoding:4
bookmarks:16: recoveryTask's |launch|()
bookmarks:17: (recoveryInput's fileHandleForWriting())'s writeData:recoveryData
bookmarks:18: (recoveryInput's fileHandleForWriting())'s closeFile()
bookmarks:19: set recoveryDigestData to (recoveryOutput's fileHandleForReading())'s readDataToEndOfFile()
bookmarks:20: recoveryTask's waitUntilExit()
bookmarks:21: if (recoveryTask's terminationStatus() as integer) is not 0 then error "WPSC_CHECKPOINT_HASH_FAILED"
bookmarks:22: set recoveryDigestText to (current application's NSString's alloc()'s initWithData:recoveryDigestData |encoding|:4) as text
bookmarks:23: if (length of recoveryDigestText) is not 68 then error "WPSC_CHECKPOINT_HASH_FAILED"
bookmarks:24: if text 65 thru 68 of recoveryDigestText is not "  -" & linefeed then error "WPSC_CHECKPOINT_HASH_FAILED"
bookmarks:25: set qualityTextHash to text 1 thru 64 of recoveryDigestText
bookmarks:26: if qa >= qualityPoint + qualityDelta then set qa to qa - qualityDelta
bookmarks:27: if qz > qualityPoint + qualityDelta then set qz to qz - qualityDelta
bookmarks:28: set end of qualityState to {"bookmark",name of qb as text,qa,qz,qualityTextHash}
